No One Lives Forever VR

The client shell in this project is derived from the NO ONE LIVES FOREVER
Source Code v1.003 (Monolith Productions, 2001) by way of
haekb/nolf1-modernizer, and REMAINS BOUND BY THE EULA IN THAT SOURCE RELEASE.

That license is not reproduced here, and it is not in the source release's
readme.txt either: that file lists an EULA section in its contents and then
prints its introduction again in place of the terms. The obligation is real
regardless - it was accepted when the source was obtained - but if you need to
read the text, get it from the original distribution rather than from anything
in this tree.

That license is NON-COMMERCIAL. This project is never to be sold, and no
payment may be taken for it or for access to it.

The D3D11 renderer (host/renstub), the OpenXR host (host/) and the tools are
original work by this project's authors. They are offered under the same terms
as the whole, because a build of this project is a derivative of the whole.

NO GAME DATA IS INCLUDED, in this repository or in any release archive. You
supply your own copy of the game.

Rights in No One Lives Forever are held today by Nightdive Studios / Ziggurat
Interactive. This is an unofficial, non-commercial fan project with no
